cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mitoxdi: Two-arm decomposition, MDI (mdi_v1.0) scoring, and composition-predicted / residual MDI for critical-illness transcriptomes"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
license: MIT
keywords:
  - transcriptomics
  - deconvolution
  - regulated cell death
  - critical illness
  - composition confounding
abstract: >-
  Open tool implementing the frozen two-arm decomposition (80-gene manifest,
  upstream-collapse 30 / execution-induction 33), the mdi_v1.0 dissociation index
  (within-cohort ungrouped z), composition-predicted MDI from purified-cell-reference
  NNLS deconvolution (Monaco/ABIS), and the composition-residual MDI, with the
  prospective judgment-gate language documented in GATE.md.
authors:
  - name: "The Mitoxyperilysis-ARDS Project Authors"
